  "correctValue": "1758",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>Wavelength of electron</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>Wave length of neutron</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>Mass of electron and neutron respectively</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>Velocity of electron and neutron respectively</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>626</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup